CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     The ssddppccoonnttrrooll utility only implements client side functionality.

     The ssddppccoonnttrrooll utility only requests the following attributes from the
     SDP server:

           1.   Service Record Handle
           2.   Service Class ID List
           3.   Protocol Descriptor List
           4.   Bluetooth Profile Descriptor List

